    c(0, "UNKNOWN_0", -1)                             // DESCRIPTIVE — current 948-5 sender jag::ClientProtSenders::SendBoundedStringWithTwoBytes_OP0 @0x10016d280 uses descriptor 0x100f13520; descriptor init writes 0xffffffff00000000 at 0x10041e106. VarByte body trims/normalizes bounded text, rejects encoded length >=0xfd, writes length/control, two caller bytes, one reserved byte, encoded text, and NUL before queueing. Original enum symbol unresolved.
